  "description": {
   "en": "The Subcontractors were nothing more than Robots I was grateful for. It was only natural to squeeze everything out of them. But after being betrayed by the group I worked for, I opened my eyes in a new body and finally saw the tears of those \"Robots.\" Having gained a second life on the brink of death, can my soul be saved?"
